    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moebius: Endless Dream</strong> is a first-person escape room puzzle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play the game with keyboard and mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a man named <strong>Nicholas</strong>, exploring a sealed and unfamiliar space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in a strange room with no memory of who you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape, you must uncover an <strong>8-letter English key</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the room, search for clues, and examine them through your <strong>inventory</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather information and piece together the key to make your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the truth</strong> that awaits you.<br>Recover the memories you\u2019ve lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two endings await, based on your final decision: <strong>Atonement</strong> or <strong>Oblivion</strong>.<br>How far can you run... from yourself?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moebius: Endless Dream</strong> is a first-person escape room puzzle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play the game with keyboard and mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a man named <strong>Nicholas</strong>, exploring a sealed and unfamiliar space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in a strange room with no memory of who you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape, you must uncover an <strong>8-letter English key</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the room, search for clues, and examine them through your <strong>inventory</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather information and piece together the key to make your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the truth</strong> that awaits you.<br>Recover the memories you\u2019ve lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two endings await, based on your final decision: <strong>Atonement</strong> or <strong>Oblivion</strong>.<br>How far can you run... from yourself?</p>",
    "short_description": "You wake up in a strange room. You must find a way out. Solve puzzles, uncover clues, and escape. The truth awaits you. In the end, where will your final choice lead you?",
